{"ref":"BDB, רָחָם","hw":"רָחָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָחָם</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong> [<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>carrion-vulture</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.18\">Lv 11:18</a> (Sam. <span dir=\"rtl\">רחמה</span>; so perhaps read) = <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרָחָ֫מָה</span> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.17\">Dt 14:17</a> (on accent v. Dr; cf. Ges<sup>§ 90f</sup>).","next":"BDB, רָחָ֫מָה","prev":"BDB, רחם²"}